        "parms": "# router and matrix — a patchbay for messages\nrouter passes messages from its data inlets to its outlets as a list of connections says. <in> <out> 1 at its left inlet connects data inlet in to outlet out, <in> <out> 0 disconnects them. Both count from 0. matrix works the same way, but each connection has a gain that scales the numbers passing through.\nMax's matrix~ mixes signals. matrix here routes messages, and two messages reaching one outlet are not added together. The connections are not saved with the patch.",
